2026-11-02T06:46:23.8568835Z usage: run_research_selection.py [-h]
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8569275Z                                  (--manifest MANIFEST | --source-card SOURCE_CARD)
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8569608Z                                  [--selection-config SELECTION_CONFIG]
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8570120Z                                  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8570394Z                                  [--decision-at-utc DECISION_AT_UTC]
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8570674Z                                  [--registry-store REGISTRY_STORE]
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8570935Z                                  [--trust-file TRUST_FILE]
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8571140Z 
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8571312Z Read sealed research inputs and emit immutable, non-authoritative decisions.
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8571554Z 
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8571640Z options:
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8571850Z   -h, --help            show this help message and exit
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8572126Z   --manifest MANIFEST   Strict JSON manifest path.
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8572375Z   --source-card SOURCE_CARD
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8572622Z                         Retained actual card JSON; generates an explicitly
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8572917Z                         retrospective diagnostic sidecar.
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8573163Z   --selection-config SELECTION_CONFIG
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8573434Z                         Optional explicit selector config for --source-card;
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8573746Z                         absent means unqualified diagnostic policy.
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8574012Z   --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8574242Z                         New output directory; its parent must exist.
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8574505Z   --decision-at-utc DECISION_AT_UTC
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8574756Z                         Optional historical UTC reference cutoff; marks
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8575062Z                         replay, actual execution time is retained.
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8575315Z   --registry-store REGISTRY_STORE
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8575575Z                         Existing local content-addressed registry directory
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8575851Z                         (read-only).
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8576068Z   --trust-file TRUST_FILE
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8576322Z                         Explicit trusted public keys, separate from registry
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8576684Z                         artifacts.
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8576853Z 
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8577068Z Manifest schema (all file references relative to the manifest):
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8577589Z   {"schema":"research-selection-manifest-v1","entries":[
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8578109Z     {"entry_id":"example","forecast":"sealed-forecast.json",
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8578882Z      "config":"selector-config.json","quality_receipt":"quality.json",
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8579605Z      "price":"price.json","components":["sealed-sibling.json"]}
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8580073Z   ]}
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8580460Z Only entry_id, forecast and config are mandatory within each entry. Optional
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8581007Z quality_receipt/price may be null; components defaults to []. Forecasts and
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8581510Z quality receipts must already be sealed by the research_selection API. Config
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8582012Z is the explicit research-selector-config-v1 payload, not its artifact wrapper.
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8582666Z No legacy probability orientation, line or settlement convention is inferred.
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8582949Z 
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8583201Z For registry verification also supply manifest registry:{"record_ids":[...],
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8583735Z "revocation_ids":[...]} and both registry flags. The separate trust JSON is
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8584223Z {"schema":"research-validation-trust-v1","public_keys_b64":{"signer":
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8584682Z "base64 raw 32-byte Ed25519 public key"}}. No keys are trusted by default.
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8585225Z User-supplied trust is not evidence of independent scientific certification.
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8585546Z 
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8597059Z Outputs: decisions.json and execution_receipt.json, in a NEW directory only.
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8597542Z Missing qualification produces BLOCKED records and exit 0; malformed inputs
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8597966Z produce exit 2. Inputs and registry are read-only. Every output remains SHADOW,
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8598422Z publication/action authority false and wagering OFF. A historical decision
2026-11-02T06:46:23.8598829Z timestamp is explicitly a retrospective diagnostic, never backdated execution.
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9143279Z usage: evaluate_research_selections.py [-h]
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9143702Z                                        (--manifest MANIFEST | --selection-sidecar SELECTION_SIDECAR)
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9144099Z                                        [--settlement-update SETTLEMENT_UPDATE]
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9144431Z                                        [--walk-forward-config WALK_FORWARD_CONFIG]
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9144739Z                                        --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9145030Z                                        [--bootstrap-samples BOOTSTRAP_SAMPLES]
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9145308Z                                        [--seed SEED]
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9145466Z 
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9145632Z Evaluate preserved selection receipts against an explicit, hash-pinned
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9146020Z population. This offline reader does not fetch finals, edit forecasts or
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9146407Z certify a procedure. Run --help for the manifest contract; outcomes remain
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9146808Z source assertions until an independent reviewer authenticates their provenance
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9147125Z and settlement mapping.
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9147252Z 
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9147318Z options:
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9147506Z   -h, --help            show this help message and exit
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9147760Z   --manifest MANIFEST
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9147963Z   --selection-sidecar SELECTION_SIDECAR
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9148227Z                         Actual automatic sidecar; paired with explicit
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9148512Z                         retained --settlement-update
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9148762Z   --settlement-update SETTLEMENT_UPDATE
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9149034Z                         Version-bound retained Oct22 corrected interim update;
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9149309Z                         discovery only
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9149531Z   --walk-forward-config WALK_FORWARD_CONFIG
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9150032Z                         External trust/store/plan/fit receipt configuration;
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9150357Z                         manifest must bind exact forecast_states
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9150628Z   --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9151083Z   --bootstrap-samples BOOTSTRAP_SAMPLES
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9151295Z   --seed SEED
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9151387Z 
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9151679Z Manifest schema research-selection-evaluation-input-v1: evidence_scope
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9152079Z DISCOVERY|SHADOW; population, decisions, outcomes and optional controls are
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9152477Z {path,sha256} references beneath the manifest directory. Population declares
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9152801Z event_id,target_id,slate_id. Outcomes declare
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9153118Z event_id,target_id,outcome,status,observed_at_utc; resolved rows also declare
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9153526Z settled_at_utc, source_sha256,source_ref. Controls are sealed forecasts on the
2026-11-02T06:46:23.9153825Z exact same target.
